<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- The vault app's launcher mark.
     It shares the Gateway Blue gate glyph with `Leasegate Approval` so the two
     read as one family, but replaces the mint chevron with a keyhole. Two
     Leasegate apps on one launcher must not be indistinguishable.

     minSdk is 26, so every supported device uses this adaptive foreground and
     the legacy mipmap PNGs are never drawn. That is why differentiating here
     is enough, and why it needs no image tooling. -->
